message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite the associated paper (see preferred-citation)."
title: "TernaryCore: Multiplier-Free Balanced Ternary GEMM Accelerator for BitNet b1.58 Inference"
abstract: "Open-source, multiplier-free ternary (-1/0/+1) MAC / dot-product / GEMM microarchitecture for BitNet b1.58 inference on a low-cost FPGA (Xilinx Artix-7, Arty A7-100T). Includes RTL, MicroBlaze firmware, host tooling, same-fabric INT8 baselines, and an inline-current-sensing energy method for reproduction."
type: software
authors:
